    {
      "step_id": 242,
      "timestamp": "2026-11-19T11:46:05.227Z",
      "source": "agent",
      "message": "",
      "tool_calls": [
        {
          "tool_call_id": "toolu_01QW3sp17CuRhD11QEqkMXED",
          "function_name": "WebSearch",
          "arguments": {
            "query": "Woolworths EV fast chargers Dakabin Glen Huntly operator app"
          }
        }
      ],
      "observation": {
        "results": [
          {
            "source_call_id": "toolu_01QW3sp17CuRhD11QEqkMXED",
            "content": "Web search results for query: \"Woolworths EV fast chargers Dakabin Glen Huntly operator app\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"PRESS RELEASE: EV drivers can now collect Everyday Rewards points when charging at Woolworths Supermarkets.\",\"url\":\"https://getthewordout.com.au/press-release/press-release-ev-drivers-can-now-collect-everyday-rewards-points-when-charging-at-woolworths-supermarkets/\"},{\"title\":\"Autel Chargers Now at IKEA and Woolworths Sites\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/reviews/autel-expands-charger-footprint-from-homes-to-the-largest-retailers-in-anz\"},{\"title\":\"Australian EV charging platform partners with retail giant's rewards program - The Driven IO\",\"url\":\"https://thedriven.io/2025/05/14/australian-ev-charging-platform-partners-with-retail-giants-rewards-program/\"},{\"title\":\"Chargefox partners with Woolworths Everyday Rewards points\",\"url\":\"https://www.propertycenterpiece.com.au/post/chargefox-partners-with-woolworths-everyday-rewards-points\"},{\"title\":\"Woolworths offering rewards for charging your Electric Vehicle\",\"url\":\"https://techau.com.au/woolworths-offering-rewards-for-charging-your-electric-vehicle/\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - EV Charging Station Map - Find a place to charge your car!\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/740224\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/609380\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/245098\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/496968\"},{\"title\":\"Woolworths Charging including DC Fast Charging\",\"url\":\"https://teslamotorsclub.com/tmc/threads/woolworths-charging-including-dc-fast-charging.317693/\"}]\n\nWoolworths' own EV chargers, including the ones at Dakabin, run on the Chargefox network. You start and pay for a charge in the Chargefox app. None of the results mentioned Glen Huntly, so I couldn't confirm who operates the chargers there.\n\n- **Dakabin (QLD):** The May 2025 store list includes Dakabin, alongside Bannockburn, Bellmere, Doolandella, Gordonvale West, Logan Reserve and Redbank Plains Mountview. These chargers are all available on the Chargefox App.\n- **How you use them:** Customers pay through the Chargefox app, which is open to all EV drivers, not only Woolworths shoppers. Everyday Rewards members can link their account in the app and earn one point per dollar spent charging at participating sites. PlugShare listings say you can also use a Chargefox RFID card.\n- **Size of the network:** In May 2025, Chargefox had over 100 EV charging plugs located across 25 Woolworths stores around Australia, with more planned.\n- **Hardware and speeds:** Autel supplies chargers at some sites. Woolworths stores offer a mix of AC and DC charging options from as slow as 7kW AC to 200 kW DC. That source is from November 2026.\n- **Pricing:** An older forum post (about 2023) quoted Chargefox prices of DC (up to 200kW) = 55c/kWh AC (7kW) = 25c/kWh. These are likely out of date.\n- **Not every charger at a Woolworths belongs to Woolworths:** Some shopping centres with a Woolworths have chargers from other networks. For example, one PlugShare listing shows Evie 50kW DC chargers near a Woolworths pick-up entrance.\n\nGlen Huntly is in Victoria, and none of these sources include a Victorian store list. If you need that site specifically, a search like \"Woolworths Glen Huntly EV charger\" or \"Glen Huntly PlugShare\" should show whether it's Chargefox or another network such as Evie, Jolt or bp pulse.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.",
            "extra": {
              "line": 282,
              "unified_event": {
                "type": "tool.execution_complete",
                "timestamp": "2026-11-19T11:46:17.295Z",
                "data": {
                  "toolCallId": "toolu_01QW3sp17CuRhD11QEqkMXED",
                  "toolName": "WebSearch",
                  "output": "Web search results for query: \"Woolworths EV fast chargers Dakabin Glen Huntly operator app\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"PRESS RELEASE: EV drivers can now collect Everyday Rewards points when charging at Woolworths Supermarkets.\",\"url\":\"https://getthewordout.com.au/press-release/press-release-ev-drivers-can-now-collect-everyday-rewards-points-when-charging-at-woolworths-supermarkets/\"},{\"title\":\"Autel Chargers Now at IKEA and Woolworths Sites\",\"url\":\"https://zecar.com/reviews/autel-expands-charger-footprint-from-homes-to-the-largest-retailers-in-anz\"},{\"title\":\"Australian EV charging platform partners with retail giant's rewards program - The Driven IO\",\"url\":\"https://thedriven.io/2025/05/14/australian-ev-charging-platform-partners-with-retail-giants-rewards-program/\"},{\"title\":\"Chargefox partners with Woolworths Everyday Rewards points\",\"url\":\"https://www.propertycenterpiece.com.au/post/chargefox-partners-with-woolworths-everyday-rewards-points\"},{\"title\":\"Woolworths offering rewards for charging your Electric Vehicle\",\"url\":\"https://techau.com.au/woolworths-offering-rewards-for-charging-your-electric-vehicle/\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - EV Charging Station Map - Find a place to charge your car!\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/740224\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/609380\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/245098\"},{\"title\":\"PlugShare - Find Electric Vehicle Charging Locations Near You\",\"url\":\"https://www.plugshare.com/location/496968\"},{\"title\":\"Woolworths Charging including DC Fast Charging\",\"url\":\"https://teslamotorsclub.com/tmc/threads/woolworths-charging-including-dc-fast-charging.317693/\"}]\n\nWoolworths' own EV chargers, including the ones at Dakabin, run on the Chargefox network. You start and pay for a charge in the Chargefox app. None of the results mentioned Glen Huntly, so I couldn't confirm who operates the chargers there.\n\n- **Dakabin (QLD):** The May 2025 store list includes Dakabin, alongside Bannockburn, Bellmere, Doolandella, Gordonvale West, Logan Reserve and Redbank Plains Mountview. These chargers are all available on the Chargefox App.\n- **How you use them:** Customers pay through the Chargefox app, which is open to all EV drivers, not only Woolworths shoppers. Everyday Rewards members can link their account in the app and earn one point per dollar spent charging at participating sites. PlugShare listings say you can also use a Chargefox RFID card.\n- **Size of the network:** In May 2025, Chargefox had over 100 EV charging plugs located across 25 Woolworths stores around Australia, with more planned.\n- **Hardware and speeds:** Autel supplies chargers at some sites. Woolworths stores offer a mix of AC and DC charging options from as slow as 7kW AC to 200 kW DC. That source is from November 2026.\n- **Pricing:** An older forum post (about 2023) quoted Chargefox prices of DC (up to 200kW) = 55c/kWh AC (7kW) = 25c/kWh. These are likely out of date.\n- **Not every charger at a Woolworths belongs to Woolworths:** Some shopping centres with a Woolworths have chargers from other networks. For example, one PlugShare listing shows Evie 50kW DC chargers near a Woolworths pick-up entrance.\n\nGlen Huntly is in Victoria, and none of these sources include a Victorian store list. If you need that site specifically, a search like \"Woolworths Glen Huntly EV charger\" or \"Glen Huntly PlugShare\" should show whether it's Chargefox or another network such as Evie, Jolt or bp pulse.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks.",
