            "source_call_id": "toolu_017aRRYjeAdfAtCtwttTfAiU",
            "content": "**Per-kWh prices:** This page has no per-kWh figures, ranges, or peak/off-peak rates. It says prices vary by station and plug type, and directs drivers to the Evie app for current connector pricing.\n\n**Per-charge estimates:** The only cost figures are per full charge, not per kWh: \"it should cost around $14 – $27 to charge a smaller vehicle or $27 – $47 to charge a long-distance vehicle.\"\n\n**Dates on the page:**\n- Publication date: \"12 Jul, 2023\"\n- Footer: \"© Copyright 2026 Evie Networks\"",
